# 验证：execute 对每个匹配实体各执行一次。
#
# 两个盔甲架 -> say 执行两次。
#
# 期望：两条 [Armor Stand] PROBE_ONE_STAND

--- function probe/multi.mcfunction ---
execute @e[type=armor_stand] ~ ~ ~ say PROBE_ONE_STAND

--- console ---
setblock 0 4 0 dirt
setblock 30 4 0 dirt
summon armor_stand 0 5 0
summon armor_stand 30 5 0
function probe:multi
